Name:Rules pilot 247 - The Shaman is not tapped for mana
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:You control Mana Reflection, Deathrite Shaman and a Swamp, and have Bump in the Night and Lightning Blast in hand. The opponent is at 4 life, controls Wall of Wood and has a Plains in their graveyard. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-048e0e7a45ee4b3c | Deathrite Shaman's first ability targets, so it is not a mana ability and activating it is not tapping it for mana (CR 106.12, 605.1a): Mana Reflection does not double it, so it makes one mana, not the two Lightning Blast would need; Bump in the Night, then the Shaman's drain exiling it, wins
